<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Health Care Provider Certification</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
        .header-title { font-size: 24pt; }
        .sub-header { font-size: 12pt; }
        .section-title { font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        .form-label { display: inline-block; width: 150px; }
        .form-input { border-bottom: 1px solid black; min-width: 200px; }
        .two-column-layout { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .two-column-layout > div { width: 48%; }
        .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
        .signature-line { border-bottom: 1px solid black; width: 40%; margin-top: 50px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: right;">
            <span class="header-title">8 Guardian</span>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;">
            <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Guardian Logo" style="height: 50px;">
            <h1 style="font-size: 20pt; margin-top: 10px;">Paid Family Leave</h1>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;">
            <h2 class="sub-header">Request For Paid Family Leave</h2>
            <h3 class="sub-header">Health Care Provider Certification For Care Of Family Member With Serious Health Condition (Form PFL-4)</h3>
            <p class="sub-header">INSTRUCTIONS INCLUDED WITH FORM</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <p>TO BE COMPLETED BY THE EMPLOYEE</p>
            <div class="two-column-layout">
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">Employee's name (first name, middle initial, last name)</div>
                    <div class="form-input">{{ employee.full_name }}</div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">Employee's date of birth (MM/DD/YYYY)</div>
                    <div class="form-input">{{ employee.dob }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="two-column-layout">
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">Other last names, if any, under which employee has worked</div>
                    <div class="form-input">{{ employee.other_names }}</div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">Employee's Social Security Number or TIN</div>
                    <div class="form-input">{{ employee.ssn_tin }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <div class="form-label">Employee's mailing address</div>
                <div class="form-input">{{ employee.address }}</div>
            </div>

            <div class="two-column-layout">
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">City, State</div>
                    <div class="form-input">{{ employee.city_state }}</div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">Zip code</div>
                    <div class="form-input">{{ employee.zip_code }}</div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">Country (if not U.S.A.)</div>
                    <div class="form-input">{{ employee.country }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <div class="form-label">Care recipient's (patient's) name (first name, middle initial, last name)</div>
                <div class="form-input">{{ care_recipient.full_name }}</div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
                <div class="form-label">Care recipient's (patient's) date of birth (MM/DD/YYYY)</div>
                <div class="form-input">{{ care_recipient.dob }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <h2 class="section-title">HEALTH CARE PROVIDER CERTIFICATION FOR CARE OF FAMILY MEMBER WITH SERIOUS HEALTH CONDITION</h2>
            <p class="sub-header">(to be completed by the health care provider for the care recipient (patient) and returned to the employee identified above)</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>The patient's health care provider must complete all applicable requested information unless noted as optional.</p>

            <div class="section-title">Patient Information / family member with serious health condition (to be completed by the health care provider for the care recipient (patient) and returned to the employee identified above)</div>

            <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
                <p>1. Does patient require care by the employee requesting Paid Family Leave(PFL)?</p>
                <div class="checkbox-group" style="margin-left: 20px;">
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> No (If no, skip to "Health Care Provider Information")</label>
                </div>
                <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">Note: For the purposes of this section, "providing care" may include necessary physical care, emotional support, visitation, assistance in treatment, transportation, arranging for a change in care, assistance with essential daily living matters, and personal attendant services.</p>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <p>2. Primary ICD-10 code (optional)</p>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 300px; border: none;">{{ icd_code }}</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <p>3. Diagnosis</p>
                <div class="form-input" style="width: 300px; border: none;">{{ diagnosis }}</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <p>4. Date patient's condition commenced (MM/DD/YYYY)</p>
                <div class="form-input">{{ condition_start_date }}</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <p>5. First date care for patient is needed (MM/DD/YYYY)</p>
                <div class="form-input">{{ first_care_date }}</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <p>6. Expected date patient will no longer require care (MM/DD/YYYY)</p>
                <div class="form-input">{{ expected_end_date }}</div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
                <p>7. Estimated number of days per week OR days per month patient requires care</p>
                <div class="two-column-layout">
                    <div>
                        <div class="form-label">Days/week</div>
                        <div class="form-input">{{ days_per_week }}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="form-label">Days/month</div>
                        <div class="form-input">{{ days_per_month }}</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
                    <label style="margin-right: 20px;">OR</label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <h2 class="section-title">Health Care Provider Information</h2>
            <p class="sub-header">(to be completed by the health care provider for the care recipient (patient) and returned to the employee identified above)</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>8. Health care provider's name</p>
            <div class="form-input" style="width: 600px; border: none;">{{ provider_name }}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>9. Type of health care provider:</p>
            <div class="two-column-layout" style="margin-top: 10px;">
                <div>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Medical Doctor (MD)</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Doctor of Osteopathy (DO)</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Doctor of Podiatric Medicine (DPM)</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Doctor of Chiropractic Medicine (DC)</label>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Dentist (DDS/DMD)</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Physician's Assistant (PA)</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Nurse Practitioner (NP)</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Licensed Psychologist</label>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Licensed Social Worker (LMSW/LCSW)</label>
                    <label><input type="checkbox"> Other (specify)</label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>10. Health care provider's mailing address</p>
            <div class="form-input" style="width: 600px; border: none;">{{ provider_address }}</div>
        </div>

        <div class="two-column-layout">
            <div>
                <div class="form-label">City, State</div>
                <div class="form-input">{{ provider_city_state }}</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="form-label">Zip code</div>
                <div class="form-input">{{ provider_zip_code }}</div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="form-label">Country (if not U.S.A.)</div>
                <div class="form-input">{{ provider_country }}</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>11. Health care provider's telephone number (provide area or country code)</p>
            <div class="form-input" style="width: 600px; border: none;">{{ provider_phone }}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>12. Health care provider's email address (if available)</p>
            <div class="form-input" style="width: 600px; border: none;">{{ provider_email }}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>13. State or country (if not U.S.A.) in which health care provider is licensed to practice</p>
            <div class="form-input" style="width: 600px; border: none;">{{ provider_license_location }}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>14. Specialty</p>
            <div class="form-input" style="width: 600px; border: none;">{{ provider_specialty }}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
            <p>15. Health care provider's license number</p>
            <div class="form-input" style="width: 600px; border: none;">{{ provider_license_number }}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <p>Certification and signature</p>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other person files an application for insurance or statement of claim containing any materially false information, or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact material thereto, commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime, and shall also be subject to a civil penalty not to exceed five thousand dollars and the stated value of the claim for each such violation.</p>
            <p>My signature attests that the information I have provided in this form is based on my professional assessment within my licensed scope of practice.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top: 80px;">
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between;">
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">Health care provider's signature</div>
                    <div class="signature-line"></div>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <div class="form-label">Date signed (MM/DD/YYYY)</div>
                    <div class="form-input">{{ signature_date }}</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="page">
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">PFL-4 (11-17) HCP Certification</p>
            <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Page 2 of 2</p>
        </div>
        <div style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 30px;">
            <p>Documents can be returned electronically at www.GuardianAnytime.com. Click on "Secure Channel" on the Guardian Anytime home page.</p>
            <p>For assistance, please call (800) 268-2525 Fax (610) 807-2950</p>
            <p>Paid Family Leave@glic.com www.ny.gov/PaidFamilyLeave</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>